{
  "business_rules": [
    "Joiner 'JNR_CLAIM_PAYMENTS' is a Master Outer Join: all DETAIL rows (sq_claim) are kept; rows with no MASTER match (agg_payments) get NULL TOTAL_INDEMNITY, TOTAL_EXPENSE (handled by V_INDEMNITY, V_EXPENSE).",
    "Lookup 'LKP_DIM_POLICY' table DIM_POLICY resolved to edw.dim_policy by unique name match in insurance_ddl.sql.",
    "System inferred from schema (dbo -> PolicyAdmin; edw/etl/audit -> InsuranceDW) per insurance_ddl.sql.",
    "Lookup 'LKP_DIM_AGENT' table DIM_AGENT resolved to edw.dim_agent by unique name match in insurance_ddl.sql.",
    "Router 'RTR_POLICY_CHECK': connector suffix '3' (POLICY_ID3) would select the default group DEFAULT1 under PowerCenter numbering, which receives no rows; wired to group POLICY_NOT_FOUND per the mapping description (claims without a current policy go to ERR_CLAIMS).",
    "Target 'FACT_CLAIMS' columns fed by differently named ports (IR targets carry no column mapping): agent_key <- o_agent_key, loss_date_key <- o_loss_date_key, reported_date_key <- o_reported_date_key, claim_status <- o_claim_status, days_to_report <- o_days_to_report, days_open <- o_days_open, total_paid_indemnity <- o_total_paid_indemnity, total_paid_expense <- o_total_paid_expense, total_paid <- o_total_paid, is_large_loss <- o_is_large_loss, dw_load_ts <- o_dw_load_ts.",
    "Target 'ERR_CLAIMS' columns fed by differently named ports (IR targets carry no column mapping): error_reason <- o_error_reason, dw_load_ts <- o_dw_load_ts.",
    "ERR_CLAIMS requires CLAIM_ID, CLAIM_NUMBER, DW_LOAD_TS, which EXP_ERROR_REASON does not output; passed through by name from upstream (O_DW_LOAD_TS for DW_LOAD_TS) because connectors are abridged (X5).",
    "Load modes from session 's_m_LOAD_FACT_CLAIMS' (not the mapping): FACT_CLAIMS truncate+insert (full_overwrite), ERR_CLAIMS insert without truncate (append)."
  ],
